    "excerpt": "India Thailand Business Opportunities, Cross-Border Investment, India Thailand trade",
    "content": "<!--[indiglobal-meta:{\"titleDescription\":\"\",\"tabTitle\":\"India Thailand Business Opportunities | India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027\",\"tabDescription\":\"Explore India–Thailand business opportunities in trade, investment, manufacturing, technology and services to identify routes for international expansion.\",\"titleOG\":\"India Thailand Business Opportunities | India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027\",\"descriptionOG\":\"Explore India–Thailand business opportunities in trade, investment, manufacturing, technology and services to identify routes for international expansion.\"}]-->\n\n[align=justify]\nIndia–Thailand business opportunities are creating new possibilities for companies looking to expand into Southeast Asia, build international networks, and strengthen regional trade. The [India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027](https://indiglobalexpo.com/), scheduled for **21–22 January 2027 in Ayutthaya and Bangkok, Thailand**, will connect Indian businesses, manufacturers, exporters, investors, and industry professionals to explore new markets and develop cross-border partnerships.\n\n[India–Thailand trade](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) offers opportunities across pharmaceuticals, medical devices, healthcare technology, engineering, manufacturing, information technology, food processing, and consumer products. Businesses can explore export markets, identify potential distributors, connect with international buyers, and understand the regulatory requirements for entering Thailand and other ASEAN markets.\n\nThe event will also encourage [business partnerships in Thailand](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) through B2B meetings, professional networking, industry discussions, and collaboration between Indian and Southeast Asian companies. These connections can help businesses identify local partners, strengthen supply chains, expand distribution networks, and develop sustainable commercial relationships.\n\nIn addition, [cross-border investment](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) can create opportunities for companies seeking joint ventures, manufacturing collaborations, technology partnerships, and regional expansion. By connecting entrepreneurs, investors, exporters, and industry stakeholders, the confluence will provide a platform to discuss business strategies and explore potential investment opportunities between India and Thailand.\n\nFor Indian MSMEs, startups, and established enterprises, the [India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) offers an opportunity to discover new markets, build strategic relationships, and explore international growth opportunities.\nJoin the [India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027](https://indiglobalexpo.com/) to strengthen business connections and explore the potential of India–Thailand trade.\n[/align]\n\n**Event:** India–ASEAN Global Confluence 2027\n**Date:** 21–22 January 2027\n**Location:** Ayutthaya and Bangkok, Thailand\n**Website:** [https://indiglobalexpo.com/](https://indiglobalexpo.com/)\n\n",
